{
  "job_B8.1.4.2_20251003_114807": {
    "chunk_text": "lymde Amalech & his folc mid swurdes ecge. \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Drihten to Moyse: Writ \u00f0ys on bec to gemynde & sile Iosue: Witodlice ic adylgye \u00d0a worhte Moyses an weofod, & genemde his naman, Drihten is min upahafennys. For \u00f0am \u00f0e Drihtnes cynesetles m\u00e6gen & Godes gefeoht by\u00f0 ongean Amaleh of cneorysse. IETHRO, se sacerd on Madian, gehyrde hu Drihten al\u00e6dde Israhela folc of Egypta lande. \u00d0a l\u00e6dde he mid him Sefforam, Moyses wif, ongean hine, & his twegen suna; o\u00f0er hatte Gerson, He eode ut ongean Iethro & cyste hine, & hi gegretton hi gesibsumum wordum: \u00f0a Moyses in eode to \u00d0a w\u00e6s Gethro bli\u00f0e for eallum \u00f0am godum \u00f0e Drihten dyde Israhela folce, for \u00f0i \u00f0e he hi generode & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Sy Drihten gebletsod, \u00f0e eow alysde of Egypta lande & of Pharaones handa. Nu ic wat \u00f0\u00e6t Drihten is m\u00e6re ofer ealle godas, for \u00f0am \u00f0e hi w\u00e6ron ofermede ongean hi. Iethro brohte gode offrunga, & Aaron & ealle \u00f0a yldestan comon & \u00e6ton mid him beforan Drihtne. \u00d0a on o\u00f0rum d\u00e6ge s\u00e6t Moyses, & he wolde deman \u00f0am folce \u00fee him beforan stod. \u00d0a Iethro \u00f0\u00e6t geseah, \u00f0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 he: Hw\u00e6t dest \u00f0u on \u00f0is folce; Hwi swincst \u00f0u ana & eal folc \u00d0a Moyses him andwyrde &",
